flowchart TD
    subgraph Sources
        A[PostgreSQL OLTP\ntransactions · subscriptions\nsubscription_events · products\nmerchants · customers]
        B[SDK / API\nStripe Events]
    end
    subgraph Ingestion
        C[Debezium\nCDC from PostgreSQL WAL]
        D[Kafka Topics\nstripe.public.transactions\nstripe.public.subscriptions\nstripe.gdpr.erasure_requests]
    end
    subgraph Processing
        E[Faust / Flink\nReal-time Fraud Scoring\np99 < 50 ms]
        F[Kafka Connect\nMongoDB Sink]
        G[Kafka → S3\nSnowpipe]
    end
    subgraph Destinations
        H[MongoDB Atlas\nfraud_events · user_sessions\napp_logs · customer_feedback\ndispute_documents · recommendations\n+ GridFS]
        I[Snowflake OLAP\nfact_transactions\nfact_subscription_events\ndim_* SCD2 · Dynamic Tables]
    end
    subgraph Orchestration
        J[Airflow + dbt\nBatch ETL · 02:00 UTC\nvalidate → dbt → freshness assert\n+ independent GDPR/CCPA branch]
    end
    subgraph Monitoring
        K[Evidently AI\nML Model Drift]
        L[Slack / PagerDuty\nAlerts]
    end
    A -->|WAL| C
    B -->|Events| D
    C -->|Avro| D
    D --> E
    D --> F
    D --> G
    E -->|fraud_score writeback| A
